+    store notrap aligned region0 v2, v0
+    store notrap aligned region1 v3, v1
+    brif v2, block1, block2
+
+block1:
+    call fn0()
+    jump block3
+
+block2:
+    jump block3
+
+block3:
+    store notrap aligned region0 v4, v0
+    store notrap aligned region1 v5, v1
+    return
+}
